%% Ray Actor Lifecycle State Machine
%% Commit: d1cce8c9dc8411fad7cfbd619350bec6f19839a3

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DEPENDENCIES_UNREADY: Actor created

    DEPENDENCIES_UNREADY --> PENDING_CREATION: Dependencies ready

    PENDING_CREATION --> ALIVE: Worker started,<br/>__init__ complete

    ALIVE --> RESTARTING: Actor crashed<br/>(if max_restarts > 0)
    ALIVE --> DEAD: Actor killed or<br/>max_restarts exceeded

    RESTARTING --> ALIVE: Restart successful
    RESTARTING --> DEAD: Restart failed or<br/>max_restarts exceeded

    DEAD --> [*]

    note right of ALIVE
        Actor is ready to
        receive method calls
    end note

    note right of RESTARTING
        State is lost unless
        checkpointed
    end note
